Z||000001||fropuff||11-21-2001||12:15 AM||||I think 14 is closer.  1/4 mile is very low 14s.  High 13s with little modification.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Hartz||11-21-2001||11:07 AM||||Hey, I had once of those once.  Great car.  I loved it.  Mine had the 6 speed, though.<P>I think most of the mags were getting low 14's on stock LT1s.  I think 14.2-14.3 is probably right.  An auto is probably right around there, too.  Maybe a bit more. <P>Anyone getting under 14 with an LT1 is either the next coming of John Force or has done some mods.<P>Later,<BR>Hartz||||reg||1
